End of test

Test ID     250
Comment     test mfenced (default)
Client ID   1
Engine      MuPAD
Command ID	Evaluate
   <mml:math display="inline">
     <mml:mrow>
       <mml:msup>
         <mml:mrow>
           <mml:mo>(</mml:mo>
           <mml:mrow>
             <mml:mi>x</mi>
             <mml:mo>+</mml:mo>
             <mml:mi>y</mi>
           </mml:mrow>
           <mml:mo>)</mml:mo>
         </mml:mrow>
         <mml:mn>2</mml:mn>
       </mml:msup>
     </mml:mrow>
   </mml:math>
End of test

SetClientPref     1,use_mfenced,0

Test ID     251
Comment     test mfenced (off)
Client ID   1
Engine      MuPAD
Command ID	Evaluate
   <mml:math display="inline">
